        "The **auditory fovea** is a region of the hearing system with a fine, sharp tuning. In CF-FM bats, that region covers the returning CF frequency. Most of the ear's detail goes to one narrow band, not to all ultrasonic frequencies equally. That band covers the frequency of the returning CF echo in these bats.",
